      "cooked": "<p>I don't know if anyone here plays the game Smash-Up but it is a game that regularly makes the rotation for us. My daughter recently asked me if they would ever do a Sentinels of the Multiverse Smash-Up expansion and the more that I thought about it the better an Idea it seemed like. They have all sorts of expansions for smash-Up, but not a superhero one. It seems like it would be a great fit. Anyway to the powers that be I am just throwing it out there that my household would buy one if it was made.</p>",
