      "created_at": "2016-05-10T02:10:55.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think various mechanics in smash up are similar to the various sentinels mechanics. Like tachyons being able to play many cards in a turn, and visionary manipulating decks are ones that I think smash up does have.&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>But I think smash up is faction based so it makes more sense to group all superheroes together instead of having speedsters etc. the team idea might work though, but I'm not sure.&nbsp;</p>",
